  "assetRegistry": {
    "$comment": "Every assetKey the catalog itself ships, because these are the assets the canvas draws from its own resources: the two project-owned Jetcaster covers in :ui-builder-artwork, the generated gate-0 cover, and the editor's own insert placeholder. A design extends this set with the keys its assets map pins through the asset lane (PUT /api/ui-builder/v1/designs/{designId}/assets/{assetKey}, ui_builder_put_asset; yschimke/compose-preview-server#478). Both reducers refuse any other key at commit (#484).",
    "keys": [
      "jetcaster.cover.android-developers-backstage",
      "jetcaster.cover.google-developers-podcast",
      "ui-builder.gate0.cover",
      "editor.placeholder"
    ]
  },
  "$comment_assetRegistry": "Copied with the components because a donor is read for it: `withBuilderVocabulary` takes the donor's asset registry so a donated `asset/image` validates against keys that exist, rather than against a null registry that accepts anything. `ComposeFoundationFaithfulnessTest` asserts exactly this in the preview server (\"every foundation carries the donor's asset registry and shelves\").",
  "components": [
    {
      "componentId": "asset/image",
      "displayName": "Image asset",
      "role": "Leaf",
      "traits": [
        "ImageContent"
      ],
      "slots": [],
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "assetKey",
          "jsonType": "string",
          "required": true,
          "notes": "The key of an asset the canvas can draw, written as {\"type\":\"assetKey\",\"value\":\"…\"}: one of statusSemantics.assetRegistry.keys, or a key pinned in the design's own assets map by PUT /api/ui-builder/v1/designs/{designId}/assets/{assetKey} (raw PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP body) or the ui_builder_put_asset MCP tool. Any other key is refused at commit, so put the picture before inserting the node. A pinned key whose bytes this lane cannot show renders as a placeholder naming it, and exports as Image(painter = ColorPainter(...)) with an ASSET_PLACEHOLDER warning."
        },
        {
          "name": "contentDescription",
          "jsonType": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "contentScale",
          "jsonType": "string",
          "required": false,
          "allowedValues": [
            "crop",
            "fit",
            "fillBounds",
